---
// BeforeAfter.astro
---

<section id="galeria" class="py-16 sm:py-20 px-4 border-b hairline-border bg-surface-alt">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
    
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-5">
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-stone-500" id="ba-kicker">PORTAFOLIO & DETALLE</span>
      <h2 id="ba-title" class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight">
        Resultados reales y trabajo al detalle.
      </h2>
      <p id="ba-desc" class="text-stone-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        Desliza el comparador sobre la fotografía para apreciar la diferencia en nuestros acabados, o contáctanos para recibir asesoría personalizada antes de tu visita.
      </p>
      <div class="border-t hairline-border pt-4 space-y-2 text-xs text-stone-700 font-mono">
        <div id="ba-bullet-1">01 / INSUMOS ORIGINALES SELECCIONADOS</div>
        <div id="ba-bullet-2">02 / ATENCIÓN PUNTUAL CON CITA PREVIA</div>
        <div id="ba-bullet-3">03 / PROTOCOLOS DE HIGIENE Y GARANTÍA LOCAL</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden border hairline-border bg-stone-900 select-none aspect-[16/10] shadow-md">
        <img id="ba-img-after" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Resultado" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
        <span id="ba-label-after" class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 z-20 px-2.5 py-1 bg-stone-900/90 text-white font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xs">
          ACABADO FINAL
        </span>

        <img id="ba-img-before" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519699047748-de8e457a634e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Antes" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover filter contrast-95" style="clip-path: inset(0 50% 0 0);" />
        <span id="ba-label-before" class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 z-20 px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/95 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xs">
          PREPARACIÓN / ANTES
        </span>

        <div id="ba-divider" class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-white z-20 pointer-events-none" style="left: 50%;">
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-9 h-9 bg-white text-stone-900 font-mono text-xs font-bold flex items-center justify-center border border-stone-400 shadow-md">
            ↔
          </div>
        </div>

        <input id="ba-slider" type="range" min="5" max="95" value="50" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-0 cursor-ew-resize z-30" />
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
